<title>USA: NYSEG has no comment on CalEnergy bid.</title>
<headline>NYSEG has no comment on CalEnergy bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York State Gas and Electric Corp (NYSEG) said it had no comment on a hostile offer launched earlier Tuesday by CalEnergy Co Inc.</p>
<p>CalEnergy said it was launching a tender offer of $24.50 per share for 9.9 percent of the company as the first step in an effort to buy the whole utility.  It also said it would be willing to pay $27.50 per share for NYSEG in a friendly transaction.</p>
</text>
